#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:146
msgid "Enable Google Fonts"
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:154
msgid ""
"Many of our importable project templates use and rely on Google Fonts. If "
"you turn off this feature, you may be unable to add custom fonts, and the "
"appearance of textual content might be compromised in projects. <br><br> Are "
"you sure you want to disable Google Fonts?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:158
msgid ""
"Making the web more beautiful, fast, and open through great typography. "
"Google Fonts provides over a thousand of web-optimized fonts that you can "
"use in your projects."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:163
msgid "Host Fonts Locally"
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:172
msgid ""
"You can host fonts from a local cache to ensure full compliance with GDPR "
"and EU regulations."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:182
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Consider adding Google Fonts %sin the Project Editor%s for convenience and "
"better performance. Fonts added here will be loaded globally, even if they "
"aren’t used."
msgstr ""

#: assets/templates/tmpl-plugin-settings.php:186
